Package: drones4health
Title: Ultra-High Resolution Drone Metrics for Spatial Health Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Josue", "Florian", , "josue.florian@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculate and extract ultra-high resolution remote sensing metrics for spatial health analysis from UAV orthomosaics. Designed to map localized infection risks within a One Health framework.
